abstract: >-
  A production-grade RV32IM System-on-Chip (SoC) featuring a five-stage pipelined
  CPU with Gshare dynamic branch prediction, hardware MDU, L1 cache subsystem,
  PMP v1.12, PLIC, DMA, low-power ICG clock gating, and SkyWater 130nm OpenRAM
  hard macro integration implemented with OpenLane 2 and OpenROAD.
